# DN-02 - request mau (IntelliJ HTTP Client hoac VS Code REST Client).
# Chay truoc: Postgres, mock (9000), identity, profile, company-service (profile dev), gateway (8080).
# Xem docs/api/DN-02-jobs.md muc 6 "Cach chay". Moi request doi chieu voi muc 8 "Ca kiem thu" cua DN-02-jobs.md.
# JD mau (DevDataSeeder, Cong ty A): ...0003-000000000001 REJECTED, ...002 PENDING, ...003 APPROVED, ...004 DRAFT, ...005 CLOSED.
# Muon dat lai 5 JD mau: xoa cac dong cua company.job_skills va company.jobs roi khoi dong lai company-service voi profile dev.

@gw = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@company = http://localhost:8085
@internalKey = dev-internal-key
@jdRejected = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000001
@jdPending = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000002
@jdApproved = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000003
@jdDraft = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000004
@jdClosed = 00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000005
# UUID ky nang co dinh cua profile-service (V2__skill_catalog.sql)
@JAVA = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000001
@SPRING_BOOT = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000002
@SQL = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000003
@GIT = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000004
@DOCKER = 00000000-0000-0000-0001-000000000011

############################## 1. Dang nhap ##############################

### 1a. hr1 (Cong ty A) -> 200 {accessToken, ...}
# @name hr1Login
POST {{gw}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr1@rikkeijobs.test", "password": "Test@123" }

### 1b. hr2 (Cong ty B)
# @name hr2Login
POST {{gw}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hr2@rikkeijobs.test", "password": "Test@123" }

### 1c. Danh muc ky nang (profile-service) -> 200, 20 ky nang {id, code, name, ...}
GET {{gw}}/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

############################## 2. Danh sach JD ##############################

### 2a. Tat ca JD cua Cong ty A -> 200 {items, total = 5, page = 1, size = 20}, moi cap nhat truoc
GET {{gw}}/companies/me/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2b. Loc Bi tra lai -> 200, 1 dong "Junior Backend Developer (Java/Spring Boot)"
GET {{gw}}/companies/me/jobs?status=REJECTED&page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2c. status sai -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
GET {{gw}}/companies/me/jobs?status=PAUSED
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2d. hr2 khong thay JD cua A -> 200, items rong
GET {{gw}}/companies/me/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr2Login.response.body.accessToken}}

############################## 3. Tao va luu nhap ##############################

### 3a. Chi co title; body gui kem companyId/status la -> 201 DRAFT, companyId = Cong ty A (truong la bi bo qua)
# @name createDraft
POST {{gw}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "JD thu DN-02", "companyId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000b2", "status": "APPROVED" }

### 3b. Thuc tap (type INTERNSHIP) kem ky nang -> 201 DRAFT, skills sap bat buoc truoc roi minScore giam dan
# @name createIntern
POST {{gw}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Thuc tap sinh Java",
  "position": "Java Intern",
  "level": "INTERN",
  "type": "INTERNSHIP",
  "quantity": 3,
  "city": "Ha Noi",
  "workMode": "ONSITE",
  "deadline": "2099-12-31",
  "description": "Hoc va lam du an Java noi bo.",
  "skills": [
    { "skillId": "{{GIT}}", "required": false, "minScore": 40 },
    { "skillId": "{{JAVA}}", "required": true, "minScore": 40 }
  ]
}

### 3c. Han nop trong qua khu -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, errors.deadline
POST {{gw}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Han nop cu", "deadline": "2020-01-01" }

### 3d. Luong min > max -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, errors.salaryMax
POST {{gw}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Luong nguoc", "salaryMin": 20000000, "salaryMax": 10000000 }

### 3e. Ky nang ngoai danh muc -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, errors.skills = "Kỹ năng không có trong danh mục"
POST {{gw}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Ky nang la", "skills": [ { "skillId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "required": true, "minScore": 40 } ] }

### 3f. minScore 0 -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, errors["skills[0].minScore"]
POST {{gw}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Diem 0", "skills": [ { "skillId": "{{JAVA}}", "required": true, "minScore": 0 } ] }

############################## 4. Gui duyet ##############################

### 4a. Gui duyet JD chi co title -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, errors liet ke moi truong thieu va skills
POST {{gw}}/jobs/{{createDraft.response.body.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4b. Them ky nang uu tien (khong co bat buoc) bang PUT /jobs/{id}/skills -> 200, van DRAFT
PUT {{gw}}/jobs/{{createDraft.response.body.id}}/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[ { "skillId": "{{DOCKER}}", "required": false, "minScore": 40 } ]

### 4c. Bo sung du thong tin chung, giu nguyen ky nang (khong gui skills) -> 200 DRAFT
PUT {{gw}}/jobs/{{createDraft.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "JD thu DN-02",
  "position": "Backend Developer",
  "level": "JUNIOR",
  "type": "FULLTIME",
  "quantity": 1,
  "city": "Ha Noi",
  "workMode": "HYBRID",
  "salaryMin": 12000000,
  "salaryMax": 20000000,
  "deadline": "2099-12-31",
  "description": "Phat trien API Spring Boot."
}

### 4d. Gui duyet khi chi co ky nang uu tien -> 400, errors = { "skills": "Cần ít nhất một kỹ năng bắt buộc" }
POST {{gw}}/jobs/{{createDraft.response.body.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4e. Them ky nang bat buoc -> 200
PUT {{gw}}/jobs/{{createDraft.response.body.id}}/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "skillId": "{{JAVA}}", "required": true, "minScore": 70 },
  { "skillId": "{{SQL}}", "required": true, "minScore": 40 },
  { "skillId": "{{DOCKER}}", "required": false, "minScore": 40 }
]

### 4f. Gui duyet -> 200 PENDING
POST {{gw}}/jobs/{{createDraft.response.body.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4g. Bam gui duyet lan hai -> 409 INVALID_JOB_STATUS, van PENDING
POST {{gw}}/jobs/{{createDraft.response.body.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4h. Sua JD dang PENDING -> 409 JOB_NOT_EDITABLE
PUT {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdPending}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Fresher ReactJS (sua)" }

############################## 5. JD bi tra lai ##############################

### 5a. Xem JD bi tra lai -> 200 REJECTED, rejectReason = "Mức lương chưa rõ đơn vị, phần quyền lợi còn sơ sài.", 9 ky nang
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdRejected}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5b. Sua luong va ky nang trong mot loi goi -> 200, van REJECTED (rejectReason con)
PUT {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdRejected}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Junior Backend Developer (Java/Spring Boot)",
  "position": "Backend Developer",
  "level": "JUNIOR",
  "type": "FULLTIME",
  "quantity": 2,
  "city": "Hà Nội",
  "address": "Số 1 Duy Tân, Cầu Giấy, Hà Nội",
  "workMode": "HYBRID",
  "salaryMin": 12000000,
  "salaryMax": 20000000,
  "description": "Phát triển API Spring Boot cho hệ thống nội bộ.",
  "requirements": "Tiếng Nhật N3 là lợi thế.",
  "benefits": "Lương tháng 13, bảo hiểm đầy đủ, 12 ngày phép.",
  "deadline": "2099-12-31",
  "skills": [
    { "skillId": "{{JAVA}}", "required": true, "minScore": 70 },
    { "skillId": "{{SPRING_BOOT}}", "required": true, "minScore": 40 },
    { "skillId": "{{GIT}}", "required": true, "minScore": 70 },
    { "skillId": "{{DOCKER}}", "required": false, "minScore": 40 }
  ]
}

### 5c. Gui duyet lai -> 200 PENDING, rejectReason = null
POST {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdRejected}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

############################## 6. Cong ty khac va vai tro ##############################

### 6a. hr2 xem JD cua Cong ty A -> 404 NOT_FOUND (giong id khong ton tai)
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdApproved}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hr2Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6b. hr2 sua JD cua Cong ty A -> 404 NOT_FOUND
PUT {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdDraft}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hr2Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dap pha JD cua A" }

### 6c. id khong ton tai -> 404 NOT_FOUND
GET {{gw}}/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000999
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6d. Khong co token -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdApproved}}

############################## 7. API noi bo cho UT-01 (KHONG qua gateway) ##############################

### 7a. Ngu canh JD Dang tuyen -> 200 {jobId, companyId, jobTitle "Thực tập sinh Tester", companyName "Công ty A",
#       status APPROVED, deadline = 00:00 ngay ke tiep han nop (+07:00), companyLocked false, hrEmails [...]}
GET {{company}}/internal/jobs/{{jdApproved}}/application-context
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### 7b. Thieu khoa -> 401 INVALID_SERVICE_KEY
GET {{company}}/internal/jobs/{{jdApproved}}/application-context

### 7c. JWT hop le khong thay duoc khoa noi bo -> 401 INVALID_SERVICE_KEY
GET {{company}}/internal/jobs/{{jdApproved}}/application-context
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7d. JD khong ton tai -> 404; jobId sai dinh dang -> 400 (doi duong dan de thu)
GET {{company}}/internal/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000999/application-context
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### 7e. Qua gateway thi khong co route -> 404 (than loi mac dinh cua gateway, khong toi company-service)
GET {{gw}}/internal/jobs/{{jdApproved}}/application-context
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

############################## 8. Ung tuyen roi sua JD Dang tuyen ##############################
# Can them recruitment-service (8083). profile-service chua co CV (HS-04) nen recruitment lay PDF CV tu mock:
# chay mock voi JWT_SECRET giong identity va MOCK_CV_OWNER_ID = id cua candidate1, recruitment voi PROFILE_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:9000
# (COMPANY_SERVICE_URL giu http://localhost:8085). Xem DN-02-jobs.md muc 6 "Cach chay".

### 8a. Xin ve SSO cho candidate1 (chi dev)
# @name candTicket
POST {{gw}}/auth/dev/sso-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lmsUserId": "lms-sv-001" }

### 8b. Doi ve lay token
# @name candSso
POST {{gw}}/auth/sso
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticket": "{{candTicket.response.body.ticket}}" }

### 8c. candidate1 ung tuyen JD Dang tuyen bang CV mau cua mock -> 201
POST {{gw}}/recruitment/jobs/{{jdApproved}}/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{candSso.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cvId": "40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001", "coverLetter": "Em xin ung tuyen vi tri thuc tap Tester." }

### 8d. Sau do HR sua JD Dang tuyen -> 200 PENDING (frontend hoi xac nhan truoc khi gui)
PUT {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdApproved}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Thực tập sinh Tester",
  "position": "Thực tập sinh Tester",
  "level": "INTERN",
  "type": "INTERNSHIP",
  "quantity": 3,
  "city": "Hà Nội",
  "address": "Số 1 Duy Tân, Cầu Giấy, Hà Nội",
  "workMode": "HYBRID",
  "salaryMin": 10000000,
  "salaryMax": 20000000,
  "description": "Mô tả công việc mẫu cho vị trí Thực tập sinh Tester.",
  "deadline": "2099-12-31"
}

### 8e. application-context gio tra status PENDING (UT-01 tu chan don moi)
GET {{company}}/internal/jobs/{{jdApproved}}/application-context
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### 8f. Dong JD: chi tu APPROVED; JD vua chuyen PENDING -> 409 INVALID_JOB_STATUS
POST {{gw}}/jobs/{{jdApproved}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{hr1Login.response.body.accessToken}}
